From 3df6249cd72508f1958bbecbf4319ff7fd36df4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:20:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/pager: don't reset the model when clicking a window
 outline

Every release on a window outline reset the pager model, even a plain
click that only switches desktop, and the rebuilt desktops briefly showed
the last one as hovered. Only reset the model after a drag.

BUG: 505574
---
 applets/pager/qml/main.qml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/applets/pager/qml/main.qml b/applets/pager/qml/main.qml
index b4211ddbbd..774e66e0a0 100644
--- a/applets/pager/qml/main.qml
+++ b/applets/pager/qml/main.qml
@@ -563,12 +563,12 @@ PlasmoidItem {
                                         // Will reset the model, destroying the reparented drag delegate that
                                         // is no longer bound to model.Geometry.
                                         root.dragging = false;
+                                        pagerModel.refresh();
                                     } else {
                                         // When there is no dragging (just a click), the event is passed
                                         // to the desktop MouseArea.
                                         desktopMouseArea.clicked(mouse);
                                     }
-                                    pagerModel.refresh();
                                 }
                             }

